        <Str Cat="Text">
          <Val><![CDATA[Azure Managed Grafana is a fully managed service for analytics and monitoring. To add the service and a Grafana dashboard, you need to create an Azure Managed Grafana resource. The necessary permissions will be automatically assigned so that the dashboard can display monitoring data.]]></Val>
